  12:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *           This module manages the HID class V1.11 following the "Device Class Definition
  13:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *           for Human Interface Devices (HID) Version 1.11 Jun 27, 2001".
  14:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *           This driver implements the following aspects of the specification:
  15:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *             - The Boot Interface Subclass
  16:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *             - The Mouse protocol
  17:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *             - Usage Page : Generic Desktop
  18:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *             - Usage : Joystick
  19:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *             - Collection : Application
  20:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *
  21:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   * @note     In HS mode and when the DMA is used, all variables and data structures
  22:Middlewares/ST/STM32_USB_Device_Library/Class/HID/Src/usbd_hid.c ****   *           dealing with the DMA during the transaction process should be 32-bit aligned.
